<title>UK: Marston, Thompson profits rise 8.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Marston, Thompson profits rise 8.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 29, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		28.9		   vs 24.7</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.03		   vs 7.30</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    29.5		   vs 27.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   187.5		  vs 171.6</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said there was a feel-good factor among consumers which had contributed to an encouraging start to the current financial year.</p>
<p>Full company name -  Marston, Thompson &amp; Evershed Plc</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
